## Validation Checklist

```
- [ ] Model parses: `agentic-mbse validate models/`
- [ ] All definitions have doc comments with sources
- [ ] Units specified: `= 3.0 [m]` not `= 3.0`
- [ ] Naming conventions followed
- [ ] No calc defs in designs/ (ADR-002)
```

